  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0003\u0007極低温きょくていおん極低温の　れいきを　くちから　ふんしゃ。しゃくねつの　マグマでもしゅんじに　こおりつかせてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "극저온의 냉기를 입에서 분사한다. 작열하는 마그마조차도 순식간에 얼려 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從嘴裡噴射極低溫的冷氣。即使是灼熱的熔岩也能使其在一瞬間變成冰塊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’air qu’il crache est tellement froid qu’il peut geler instantanément du magma en fusion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aus seinem Maul stößt es unfassbare Kälte aus, die sogar glühendes Magma augenblicklich gefrieren lässt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Exhala un aliento extremadamente frío por la boca que es capaz de congelar al instante incluso magma al rojo vivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Emette dalla bocca un getto d’aria glaciale con cui può congelare all’istante anche del magma incandescente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon blasts cryogenic air out from its mouth. This air can instantly freeze even liquid-hot lava.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0003\u0007極低温きょくていおん極低温の　冷気を　口から　噴射。灼熱の　マグマでも瞬時に　凍りつかせてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从嘴里喷射极低温的冷气。即使是灼热的熔岩，也能使其在一瞬间变成冰块。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Exhala un aliento extremadamente frío por la boca que es capaz de congelar al instante incluso magma al rojo vivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さかさまになり　くちから　れいきをふきだす　ちからで　とっしん。せびれのつるぎで　てきを　しとめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물구나무선 채 입으로 냉기를 뿜어내서 그 추진력으로 돌진하고는 등지느러미의 검으로 적을 처치한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會倒轉身體並從口中吐出冷氣，然後利用其推力朝敵人猛衝，以背鰭的劍給予致命一擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se met tête en bas et crache de l’air glacé pour se propulser dans les airs et charger ses ennemis, qu’il élimine avec sa crête dorsale acérée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es stürzt sich kopfüber in den Kampf, indem es eisigen Atem aus dem Maul stößt. Mit seiner Rückenflossenklinge erledigt es Feinde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se coloca boca abajo y se propulsa con su aliento gélido para cargar contra sus rivales, a los que remata con la hoja de su placa dorsal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si mette a testa in giù e soffia un vento gelido dalla bocca per spingersi contro il nemico e trafiggerlo con la lama della sua cresta dorsale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It launches itself into battle by flipping upside down and spewing frigid air from its mouth. It finishes opponents off with its dorsal blade.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "逆さまになり　口から　冷気を吹きだす　力で　突進。背びれの剣で　敵を　仕留める。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
